variant 0x40000000 ramTop 0x40000000
region 0x0 0x40000000 ram
region 0xfc000000 0x2000000 reserved
region 0xfe000000 0x1850000 device
region 0xff850000 0x7b0000 reserved
probe 0x0 ram
